  <compounddef id="action__client__node_8py" kind="file" language="Python">
    <compoundname>action_client_node.py</compoundname>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceaction__client__node">action_client_node</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>A ROS action client node for sending navigation goals and monitoring robot status. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This node interfaces with the <computeroutput>/reaching_goal</computeroutput> action server to send goals, cancel them, retrieve feedback, and track the robot&apos;s movement using <computeroutput>/odom</computeroutput> messages. It also interacts with a custom service <computeroutput>/get_last_target</computeroutput> to store and retrieve the last target location.</para>
<para><bold>Subscribes to:</bold> <linebreak/>
 <computeroutput>/odom</computeroutput> (Odometry messages)</para>
<para><bold>Publishes to:</bold> <linebreak/>
 <computeroutput>/robot_status</computeroutput> (Custom RobotStatus messages)</para>
<para><bold>Action Server:</bold> <linebreak/>
 <computeroutput>/reaching_goal</computeroutput> (PlanningAction)</para>
<para><bold>Service Client:</bold> <linebreak/>
 <computeroutput>/get_last_target</computeroutput> (GetLastTarget)</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Shady </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2025 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
